<title>FRANCE: Alcatel wins $42 mln in China GSM orders.</title>
<headline>Alcatel wins $42 mln in China GSM orders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom's Telecom unit said it had received three extension orders from China's Jilin PTA, Shanghai PTA and Zhejiang PTA for the supply of switching and radio infrastructure for their GSM networks.</p>
<p>It said the contracts were worth $42 million.</p>
<p>Alcatel also signed a contract with Jiangsu PTA for the delivery of a concentric cell trial network for Nanjing.</p>
</text>
